    "Nxd4"
   ],
   "spoken": "This is a Scotch where the queen's knight was never committed — an odd but pleasant version, with the bishop already leaning on the centre. The most ambitious choice isn't a quiet developing move but to castle: it keeps a central break in reserve for the right moment, and it readies a rook to pile onto the weak e-pawn.",
