   "line": [
    "Re8"
   ],
   "spoken": "Press the luck — the rook swings to e8 to attack the weak pawn. If the opponent props it with the f-pawn, that's a huge concession, weakening the diagonal and inviting a central strike.",
   "kind": "plan"
  },
  {
   "ply": 13,
