   "line": [
    "Qf6"
   ],
   "spoken": "The queen to f6 does triple duty — attacking, defending, and eyeing threats at once. And if the opponent lunges the queen out, the central pawn advances to shove the knight back, and the position is officially consolidated.",
   "kind": "plan"
  },
  {
