   "fen": "r1b1r1k1/pppp1p2/2n2q1p/2b3p1/3N4/2P3B1/P1P1BPPP/R2QK2R w KQ - 3 13",
   "line": [
    "Nc6"
   ],
   "spoken": "Rather than the automatic pawn move, develop as incisively as possible — with threats. The knight to c6 piles onto the enemy knight immediately, and if it's captured, a recapture leaves a piece hanging. Develop while harassing, not just developing.",
   "kind": "plan"
  },
  {
