   "line": [
    "Nxd4"
   ],
   "spoken": "When there's a choice of recaptures, take with the knight rather than the queen — keeping the dark-squared bishop, because bishops guard weak squares better than knights do. Grabbing with the queen would tempt a trade but creates no threat and lets a pawn fall.",
