   "spoken": "The two things that reassured the intuition before a single line was calculated: after the pawn thrust the enemy knight hangs, which is a free tempo, and the king is uncastled, which is another tempo lost to getting safe. The whole risk came down to a race — whether the extra pawn could be consolidated before the counterplay arrived.",
